        "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/event/the-grand-tour/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Grand Tour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A Loudmouth Production After selling out 13 consecutive shows on PEI and many other venues throughout the Maritimes, The Grand Tour are making their first appearance in Charlottetown at the Confederation Centre! &#8220;THE GRAND TOUR&#8221; is a timeless journey through classic country music! Join us for electrifying performances of hits from the 50’s, 60’s, 70’s, and 80’s. Experience the soulful voices of George Jones, Johnny Cash, Conway Twitty, Jim Reeves, Charley Pride and much more, brought to life with fresh energy and passion. These talented musicians from PEI have taken the Maritimes classic country music fans by storm! They will have you remembering the days when you would sing along to the radio! Don&#8217;t miss this nostalgic celebration of country music&#8217;s rich heritage! For more information, visit www.thegrandtour.ca"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Music, On Stage"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
