        "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/event/heroes-and-legends/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Heroes and Legends: dance umbrella Year End Recital"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Confederation Centre’s dance umbrella program presents its annual year-end recital. This year’s showcase, titled Heroes and Legends, celebrates the imagination, passion, and hard work of our talented dancers of all ages and levels. Inspired by iconic figures from myth, history, and modern storytelling, Heroes and Legends brings to life tales of courage, strength, and transformation through movement. From bold superheroes to timeless legends, each piece highlights the creativity and dedication of our students as they take the stage with confidence and joy.   This year’s matinee performance includes Creative Movement; Junior, Beginner &amp; Elementary levels in Ballet, Jazz, Contemporary &amp; Musical Theatre; student choreographies and our Performance Group.     The evening performance includes Elementary, Intermediate &amp; Senior levels in Musical Theatre levels; Intermediate, Senior &amp; ITP levels in Ballet, Jazz and Contemporary; all adult classes including Dance for Health; and our Performance Group.      The artists we present during CompassTech LIVE @ the Centre are terrific performers. We are so confident you’ll enjoy these shows, we’re offering a Money-Back Guarantee for the 2026 LIVE at the Centre season. Try something new without the worry. See full Money-Back Guarantee terms for details."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Arts Education, dance umbrella, Live@TheCentre, On Stage"
      }
    ],
