    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Soak in the fascinating stories of Prince Edward Island’s past at this engaging cabaret-style presentation. An expert in Island history will guide you through engrossing tales, rare images, and little-known facts. Whether you&#8217;re a history buff, a curious visitor, or a proud Islander, you’ll walk away with a deeper appreciation for the people, events, and forces that shaped this remarkable place. &nbsp; Photo Credit: Public Archives and Records Office of Prince Edward Island, Acc4314/s1/ss10/2/13: &#8220;Summerside Custom House with the local Prohibition Officers,&#8221; [ca. 1901-1920s ]"
