        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join a spine-tingling guided Ghost Tour through the historic downtown of Charlottetown. Led by a mysterious gravedigger, uncover haunted tales, dark legends and the secret past of Prince Edward Island’s capital. Book your haunted walking tour now!"
      }
