      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Confederation Singers present a Spring Concert centred around the natural cycles and seasons of our world. Through a wide range of musical influences both local and global, we investigate how this patient yet persistent movement can nurture a turn toward love and healing in the circles of our own lives."
