    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "C&#8217;Mon In! An Island Kitchen Party"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This summer, the Island’s best kitchen party is at The Mack. C&#8217;MON IN! throws open the door and invites you straight into a lively Maritime kitchen, where the party&#8217;s already started, the stories get bigger as the night goes on, and the music keeps everyone around the table just a little longer. Led by crowd favourites Robbie Doherty and Pierce Clarke, this laugh-out-loud, music-filled night brings together the songs Islanders know by heart and visitors can’t help but join in. With surprise moments, playful banter, and a band that knows how to keep the party rolling, you never quite know who’s going to walk through the kitchen door next. From foot-stomping classics to sing-along favourites, C’mon In! celebrates the very best of Atlantic Canadian music, including Stompin’ Tom, Anne Murray, Great Big Sea, and more. Grab a chair, sing along if you like, and settle in for one of the most fun nights out of the summer. Preview Performances: June 6, June 11 Opening Night: June 12 &nbsp; Charlottetown Festival · Summer 2026 📅 2026 Festival Schedule ●Anne of Green Gables – The Musical™ ●Come From Away ●C&#8217;mon In! An Island Kitchen Party ●Polka Dot Door Complete calendar of performances [&hellip;]"
      }
    ],
