    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Forrest Jones Entertainment presents Warning: This show contains partial nudity and includes strobe lighting and fog effects. This is a 19+ event. Any ticket holder unable to present valid government-issued identification confirming they are at least 19 years of age will not be admitted and will not be eligible for a refund. Close your eyes and imagine your wildest night out—then watch it come to life. The SIXX PAXX DREAMS TOUR arrives in 2026/27, taking the internationally acclaimed sensation to the biggest stages they’ve ever played. This all-new production turns up the heat with more seduction, more passion, and more unforgettable moments—featuring electrifying choreography, live vocals, and a high-impact show that begins like a dream and stays with you long after the final bow. Perfect for a girls’ night out, birthday celebration, or bachelorette party, SIXX PAXX delivers an interactive, high-energy experience where fantasy meets world-class performance. You’ve Seen The Rest – Now See The BEST!"
