        "@value": "Summer Camps - Confederation Centre of the Arts"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Confederation Centre of the Arts Summer Camps are creative, immersive arts experiences for children and youth aged 5–17 throughout July and August. Designed to foster a love and understanding of different art forms, our programs go beyond typical summer activities by combining expert instruction, professional arts exposure, and creative community."
      }
    ],
