  {
    "@id": "_:g2614980",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/HaKeenaManeso-1.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ha’Keena Maneso"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ha’Keena Maneso is a dancer, singer and actor originally from Moose Jaw, Saskatchewan. She is thrilled to be returning to Anne of Green Gables for her second year! Ha’Keena studied Musical Theatre at St. Lawrence College in Brockville, ON. Some of her previous credits include: Globe Theatre - Bring It On! (Nautica), Drayton Entertainment - Shrek The Musical (Gingy), Beautiful: A Carole King Musical (Shirelle), Ovation Theatre - Into The Woods (Little Red), Charlottetown Theatre Festival - Anne of Green Gables (Tillie Boulter), Jersey Boys, YES Theatre - Groundhog Day The Musical, Theatre Aquarius - Pollyanna (Fannie), A Christmas Story, Tweed and Company - Joseph and The Amazing Technicolour Dreamcoat (Brother), Stephenville Theatre Festival - 9 to 5 (Kathy), St. Lawrence College - Rocky Horror Picture Show (Magenta), Pippin (Leading Player), Apothecary (Lady), Cats (Bombalurina). Ha’Keena wants to thank her Kindred Spirits back home, her friends and family, for their love and support; she would not be here without you! "
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g2615000",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Andrew-McAllister-2.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Andrew McAllister"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "RAISED IN: Quispamsis, NB  FOR THE CENTRE: 8th Season. Anne™, The Full Monty, Evangeline, Canada Rocks!, Alice Through the Looking-Glass, JC Superstar, etc.  THEATRE: Beauty &amp; The Beast (Port Hope &amp; Capitol Theatre, NB); King Arthur, Robin Hood, and My Fair Lady (Port Hope); The Little Prince (Theatre Calgary); Elf! The Musical, West Side Story (Neptune); Hair (The Grand Theatre). — He is thrilled to be back in paradise! Thanks to the creative team and the TH Gang. Andrew wants to dedicate this to his dad and family; not a day goes by he doesn’t think of all of them! @mcallisa"
      }
    ]
  },
