    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "MALINDA CARROLL – Mrs. Pye / u/s Miss Stacey, Mrs. MacPherson\r\nFOR THE CENTRE: Debut. THEATRE: Rent, Richard II (Stratford Festival); We’ll\r\nMeet Again (Drayton Entertainment); 9 to 5 (Capitol Theatre); Hairspray (Theatre\r\nAquarius); Dear Evan Hansen (Mirvish). TRAINING: Music Theatre Performance,\r\nSt. Clair College. Thank you for being here as we experience these moments\r\ntogether. Cheers to theatre and being here now. IG: malindacarroll_"
      }
