    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Shakeil Rollock"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "SHAKEIL ROLLOCK – Ensemble / u/s Bob Crewe\r\nFOR THE CENTRE: Anne of Green Gables–The Musical™, Tell Tale Harbour.\r\nTHEATRE: Gypsy, A Grand Night for Singing (Shaw Fesitval); Mary Poppins, Elf\r\nThe Musical (The Grand); Fiddler on the Roof (Drayton Entertainment). FILM/\r\nTV: Sneakerella, Spin (Disney+); Locke and Key, Grand Army (Netflix), American\r\nGods (Amazon Prime). TRAINING: York University, The School of Toronto Dance\r\nTheatre. I’m beyond grateful to have another beautiful season on the Island.\r\nIG: shakroll"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
