        "@value": "RAISED IN: Quispamsis, NB  FOR THE CENTRE: 8th Season. Anne™, The Full Monty, Evangeline, Canada Rocks!, Alice Through the Looking-Glass, JC Superstar, etc.  THEATRE: Beauty &amp; The Beast (Port Hope &amp; Capitol Theatre, NB); King Arthur, Robin Hood, and My Fair Lady (Port Hope); The Little Prince (Theatre Calgary); Elf! The Musical, West Side Story (Neptune); Hair (The Grand Theatre). — He is thrilled to be back in paradise! Thanks to the creative team and the TH Gang. Andrew wants to dedicate this to his dad and family; not a day goes by he doesn’t think of all of them! @mcallisa"
      }
    ]
  },
