      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Join us at the Confederation Centre Art Gallery for our Seniors Art Activities. Explore and discuss the diverse works in our current exhibitions through a guided tour, followed by refreshments and a relaxed art and craft session in the Michael S. Schurman Family Studio. Details: Time: 10:00 a.m. – 12:00 p.m. Cost: $10 per session Refreshments: Coffee, tea, and cookies provided Dates: March 5th, April 2nd, May 7th. Instructor: Andreas Fobes is a filmmaker and educator originally from Ottawa, Ontario. He holds a BFA from Mount Allison University and an MA in Animation from the University of the West of England. As the Visual Arts Educator, he works to make both creating and experiencing visual art engaging, accessible, and fun for all ages."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Art Gallery, Classes, Gallery Events, Visual Arts"
      }
    ],
