    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/fr/event/the-australian-bee-gees-show/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "The Australian Bee Gees Show-A Tribute to the Bee Gees"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "A Pacquette Productions Presentation Direct from Las Vegas! It&#8217;s Saturday Night Fever every night with&#8220;The Australian Bee Gees Show – A Tribute to the Bee Gees&#8221;. One of the most successful and adored acts in musical history is recreated live in concert. You’ll hear hits like, &#8220;Staying Alive&#8221;, &#8220;You Should Be Dancing,&#8221; &#8220;How Deep Is Your Love,&#8221; and &#8220;Jive Talkin.” A Celebration of the Brothers Gibb The performers&#8217; authentic take on the trio&#8217;s clothes, style and moves showcase five decades of the Brothers Gibb&#8217;s success as rock and disco legends, while audiences groove to their memorable music and are immersed in the disco era. Acclaim &amp; Recognition “In my opinion they are the best Bee Gees tribute in the world!”— The President of the Bee Gees Fan Club, USA The Las Vegas Review Journal has named them Best Tribute Show for 2015."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
