    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Explore one of Canada’s most historic streets and learn about Prince Edward Island’s role in shaping history. From the Island’s first inhabitants to Confederation and beyond, this tour is a wonderful entry point into Canadian history. "
